# Unit01
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit01核心词汇

abandon /əˈbændən/ v. 放弃；抛弃 / The scientist abandoned the experiment due to lack of funding.
ability /əˈbɪləti/ n. 能力；才能 / She has the ability to solve complex mathematical problems.
able /ˈeɪbl/ adj. 有能力的；能干的 / He is able to finish the task ahead of schedule.
abnormal /æbˈnɔːrml/ adj. 异常的；不正常的 / The doctor noticed abnormal cells in the tissue sample.
aboard /əˈbɔːrd/ adv./prep. 在船(车/飞机)上 / All passengers are now aboard the aircraft.
abolish /əˈbɑːlɪʃ/ v. 废除；废止 / The government decided to abolish the outdated law.
about /əˈbaʊt/ prep./adv. 关于；大约 / The discussion about climate change lasted for hours.
above /əˈbʌv/ prep./adv. 在…上方；超过 / The temperature rose above 35 degrees yesterday.
abroad /əˈbrɔːd/ adv. 在国外 / She plans to study abroad next year.
absence /ˈæbsəns/ n. 缺席；不在 / His absence from the meeting was noticed by everyone.
absent /ˈæbsənt/ adj. 缺席的；不在的 / Three students were absent from class today.
absolute /ˈæbsəluːt/ adj. 绝对的；完全的 / I have absolute confidence in her ability.
absorb /əbˈzɔːrb/ v. 吸收；吸引 / The sponge can absorb a large amount of water.
abstract /ˈæbstrækt/ adj./n. 抽象的；摘要 / The concept of infinity is too abstract for young children.
absurd /əbˈsɜːrd/ adj. 荒谬的；可笑的 / It is absurd to believe that the earth is flat.
abundance /əˈbʌndəns/ n. 丰富；充裕 / There is an abundance of natural resources in this region.
abundant /əˈbʌndənt/ adj. 丰富的；充裕的 / The area has abundant rainfall throughout the year.
abuse /əˈbjuːz/ v./n. 滥用；虐待 / The abuse of power will eventually lead to corruption.
academic /ˌækəˈdemɪk/ adj./n. 学术的；学者 / Academic research requires patience and dedication.
academy /əˈkædəmi/ n. 学院；研究院 / She was admitted to the Royal Academy of Arts.
accelerate /əkˈseləreɪt/ v. 加速；促进 / The government aims to accelerate economic growth.
accent /ˈæksent/ n. 口音；重音 / His British accent makes him easy to recognize.
accept /əkˈsept/ v. 接受；承认 / She decided to accept the job offer.
access /ˈækses/ n./v. 通道；访问 / Students have access to the library 24 hours a day.
accident /ˈæksɪdənt/ n. 事故；意外 / The car accident caused a traffic jam on the highway.
accommodate /əˈkɑːmədeɪt/ v. 容纳；适应 / The hotel can accommodate up to 500 guests.
accompany /əˈkʌmpəni/ v. 陪伴；伴随 / Lightning is often accompanied by thunder.
accomplish /əˈkɑːmplɪʃ/ v. 完成；实现 / She accomplished her goal of running a marathon.
account /əˈkaʊnt/ n./v. 账户；描述 / Please give us an account of what happened.
accumulate /əˈkjuːmjəleɪt/ v. 积累；堆积 / Dust accumulates quickly on the furniture.
accurate /ˈækjərət/ adj. 准确的；精确的 / The report provides an accurate description of the event.
accuse /əˈkjuːz/ v. 指控；指责 / He was accused of stealing confidential documents.
accustom /əˈkʌstəm/ v. 使习惯 / It takes time to accustom oneself to a new environment.
achieve /əˈtʃiːv/ v. 达到；实现 / Hard work is the key to achieving success.
achievement /əˈtʃiːvmənt/ n. 成就；成绩 / Winning the Nobel Prize is a remarkable achievement.
acknowledge /əkˈnɑːlɪdʒ/ v. 承认；致谢 / She acknowledged that she had made a mistake.
acquaint /əˈkweɪnt/ v. 使熟悉；使了解 / Let me acquaint you with the new regulations.
acquire /əˈkwaɪər/ v. 获得；学到 / She acquired a new skill through years of practice.
acquisition /ˌækwɪˈzɪʃn/ n. 获得；收购 / Language acquisition begins at an early age.
acre /ˈeɪkər/ n. 英亩 / The farm covers an area of 200 acres.
across /əˈkrɔːs/ prep./adv. 穿过；对面 / The bridge across the river was built in 1990.
act /ækt/ v./n. 行动；法案 / The new act was passed by Congress last week.
action /ˈækʃn/ n. 行动；作用 / We must take immediate action to address the problem.
active /ˈæktɪv/ adj. 积极的；活跃的 / She takes an active part in community service.
activity /ækˈtɪvəti/ n. 活动；行为 / Outdoor activities are beneficial to health.
actual /ˈæktʃuəl/ adj. 实际的；真实的 / The actual cost was much higher than expected.
acute /əˈkjuːt/ adj. 急性的；敏锐的 / There is an acute shortage of medical supplies.
adapt /əˈdæpt/ v. 适应；改编 / It is important to adapt to new circumstances quickly.
add /æd/ v. 增加；补充 / Please add some sugar to the coffee.
addict /əˈdɪkt/ n./v. 上瘾者；使上瘾 / He is addicted to playing video games.
